{"v":3,"desc":"劇情RPG「閃之軌跡」系列完結篇！\n『英雄傳說 閃之軌跡IV -THE END OF SAGA-』終於登場！\n\n《巨碩黃昏》使得『詛咒』在埃雷波尼亞帝國中擴散開。與卡爾瓦德共和國之間的大戰即將爆發，此時新舊《VII班》將如何採取行動呢？而遭到失控的鬼之力吞沒，甚至失去了自我的《灰色騎士》黎恩又將面臨什麼樣的命運？\n\n本作將搭載於日文版『英雄傳說 閃之軌跡IV SUPER PRICE』版新增的「高速略過模式」、「自動戰鬥模式」，並且在Nintendo Switch™版甚至可切換最高以６倍速推進事件、原野探索或是戰鬥，以提供玩家更加舒適暢快的遊戲體驗。\n追加新區域、歷代系列作角色客串參戰、豐富的小遊戲、眾多角色活躍的大量委託等等，軌跡系列的所有要素全都凝聚在這部系列完結篇當中！","publisher":"Clouded Leopard Entertainment","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["韓文","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 12.6GB / Switch 12.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d56f65fe6b73d468e957882a006e65021c7e27baddb5f1e567530d7b3f66595f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3f2737b7bfb7bccb547b574316b21edd1f4ffbc555f70a70b44a935075923abc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d6945f12ccef3cbfc0cd4e75499e71c53e365d172738eee90c71b918533c94db.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4a6ecc14353ae2de7dae88023bfa8a0dfaf2ba995834515be8a92436d03dc29d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0e863b5355780aed4cd2ed048d3ee38a9895dd0bc3b436021bb4d591f5e85be1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/169b21d24b46604ea065f7412ab3cad8bbaa413151512fcfdb65f8817bc3a45e.jpg"],"titleId":"0100de90162a0000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000031405","name":"DLC服裝「魔法少女夢幻☆小亞」","img":"b5b5d3ce8c2a2799a7be96c0b9cbac1823f61d32bfb70c45ffcf882c24048956","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000031406","name":"DLC服裝「克洛斯貝爾野外求生裝」","img":"b1c635f29dd164cc58cad9c1a1a860ab89821d6507339101f4c6c09ea57c4aac","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000031407","name":"DLC服裝「異國旗袍」","img":"69c35dc63a49e56787fdcb3650aa5f18f19ef2e49babe7a02b117a1ad35b9616","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000031408","name":"DLC服裝「亞爾緹娜特務裝」","img":"cfad0ce5a3bd399e5d57235a153cac140ea22787032fc74ec9ca008b3c758382","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000031409","name":"DLC服裝「米莉亞姆諜報活動服」","img":"24d5045016fc60dc14d66833a3ff5f5c1c0